<title>UK: Virgin Atlantic lifts ex-UK air cargo rates.</title>
<headline>Virgin Atlantic lifts ex-UK air cargo rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virgin Atlantic said it is lifting air cargo rates from the UK by between three and seven percent from April 1, depending on the prevailing market strengths of the routes.</p>
<p>Virgin also listed conditions under which it will drop the temporary fuel surcharge which it introduced on November 4, a Virgin statement said.</p>
</text>
